							"name": "Heroic Feats of Strength",
							"local_notes": "Lore: See parent trait.\n\nDesign: Basic's Heroic Feats of Strength (flat 10) with Area Effect plus Warp Sorcery/Perils, net +20%. Full modified cost: 10 x 1.2 = 12 points; needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20).",
