							"name": "Fearlessness",
							"local_notes": "Lore: See parent trait.\n\nDesign: Basic's Fearlessness (2/level) with Area Effect plus Warp Sorcery/Perils, net +20%. Full modified cost: 2 x 1.2 = ~2 points/level; needs Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20).",
